<title>CANADA: HORSE RACING-LIT DE JUSTICE WINS BREEDERS' CUP SPRINT.</title>
<headline>HORSE RACING-LIT DE JUSTICE WINS BREEDERS' CUP SPRINT.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-10-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lit de Justice won the $1 million Breeders' Cup Sprint at Woodbine Racetrack on Saturday.</p>
<p>Paying Dues finished second, with Honour and Glory third.</p>
</text>
